#: rc.cpp:760
msgid "Sort Bookmarks Menu"
msgstr "Leestekenmenü sorteren"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:137
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, rbSortBookmarksByCreation)
#: rc.cpp:763
msgid ""
"Each new bookmark will be added to the bottom, independently from where it "
"is placed in the document."
msgstr ""
"Nieg Leestekens warrt nerrn toföögt, ehr Positschoon in't Dokment speelt "
"keen Rull."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:140
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, rbSortBookmarksByCreation)
#: rc.cpp:766
msgid "By c&reation"
msgstr "Na &Opstellen"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:147
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, rbSortBookmarksByPosition)
#: rc.cpp:769
msgid "The bookmarks will be ordered by the line numbers they are placed at."
msgstr ""
"De Leestekens warrt na de Nummer vun de Reeg sorteert, woneem se staht."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:150
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, rbSortBookmarksByPosition)
#: rc.cpp:772
msgid "By &position"
msgstr "Na &Positschoon"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:166
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkDeveloperMode)
#: rc.cpp:778
msgid ""
"Changing this mode affects only newly opened / created documents. In KWrite "
"a restart is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ännern warkt sik bloots op nieg opmaakt / opstellt Dokmenten ut. För KWrite "
"is en Niegoproop anraadt."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:169
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDeveloperMode)
#: rc.cpp:781
msgid "Enable power user mode (KDE 3 mode)"
msgstr "Baasbruker-Bedrief anmaken (KDE-3-Bedrief)"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:176
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkShowIndentationLines)
#: rc.cpp:784
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, the editor will display vertical lines to help identify "
"indent lines."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, wiest de Editor pielrecht Lienen, de bi't Opfinnen vun "
"Inrücken hölpt."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:179
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkShowIndentationLines)
#: rc.cpp:787
msgid "Show i&ndentation lines"
msgstr "I&nrücklienen wiesen"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/appearanceconfigwidget.ui:186
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkShowWholeBracketExpression)
#: rc.cpp:790
